{"title":"Rouge Park","startsAt":"2026-10-04T06:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-04T08:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Our group will leave at the posted time, so please arrive early. Please cancel your RSVP if you can't make it. Hikes take place rain or shine, but double-check that the hike will take place approximately an hour before the event start time to confirm that extreme weather isn't forcing the cancellation of the event. You must be on the going list in order to attend. If you aren't on the going list, please do not attend.\n\nThe distance is undetermined at this point, but in the neighbourhood of 9.5 km. The speed will be about 5 km/hr.\n\nThis is a sunrise rise, so we'll have a long pause at the top of Beare Hill at 7:15 to watch the sunrise.\n\nBring water and wear appropriate clothing and shoes to hike in. If applying anything scented to your person please do so away from the group in minimal amounts, as there are some that are allergic to strong scents (colognes , bug\nsprays,...).\n\nRequired reading for you and your guests before RSVP'ing to all events:\n\n1. [Liability Waiver and Group Rules](https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vR0LFNJVYn5j1AYl8eR63HjAxKMkRwg5ifKXqL3rP6Xl7v_Wcsx4xR_kNFluE3eILpSmP-EJ0OouQvT/pub) (updated 05/30/22)\n2. When asked at RSVP time, indicate **\\*Yes\\*** if you agree to the question provided.\n3. See general information about [Tick Safety](https://www.ontario.ca/page/lyme-disease)","venue":{"name":"Twyn Rivers Parking Lot","address":"55 Twyn Rivers Drive, Toronto","lat":43.814274,"lng":-79.15412,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Short Fast Hikes - Scarborough, Pickering, Ajax, Oshawa","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/3/f/highres_534181599.jpeg"}